\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces A run on the fixed competition track (\texttt  {final.toml}), from the simulator, colored by speed. Left, top-down: the wide loops are the blind spiral search that covers the arena; once all four gates are found the drone races them, slow (blue to green) at the gates and tight turns and fast (orange to red) on the straights. Green bars are the gate openings with the crossing direction, red marks are obstacles with their keep-out and the star is the start. Right, three-dimensional: the search spiral runs high, above the obstacle poles, then the drone descends to race the gates.}}{5}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:racingline}{{5}{5}{}{figure.5}{}}
